# Inventura: sync rules (Supabase)

- Sync must be resilient: handle timeouts, offline, and server errors.
- Never assume the server is reachable.
- Prefer incremental sync (only changed records), not full re-download.
- If conflict resolution exists, keep it consistent and documented in code comments.
- Never store secrets (keys/tokens) directly in code; use environment variables or safe config.